{"suttaId":"tha-ap229","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[7904,7919],"vripara":"34"},"segments":{"tha-ap229:0.3":"Sovaṇṇavaṭaṃsakiyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap229:1.1":"“Uyyānabhūmiṃ niyyanto, addasaṃ lokanāyakaṃ;","tha-ap229:1.3":"Vaṭaṃsakaṃ gahetvāna, sovaṇṇaṃ sādhunimmitaṃ.","tha-ap229:2.1":"“Sīghaṃ tato samāruyha, hatthikkhandhagato ahaṃ;","tha-ap229:2.3":"Buddhassa abhiropesiṃ, sikhino lokabandhuno.","tha-ap229:3.1":"“Ekattiṃse ito kappe, yaṃ pupphamabhiropayiṃ;","tha-ap229:3.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, pupphapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap229:4.1":"“Sattavīse ito kappe, eko āsiṃ janādhipo;","tha-ap229:4.3":"Mahāpatāpanāmena, cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap229:5.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap229:6.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā sovaṇṇavaṭaṃsakiyo thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap229:7.1":"Sovaṇṇavaṭaṃsakiyattherassāpadānaṃ sattamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
